;"Rank-based superhero rules: attributes, percentile checks, health and
  karma. Numbers only; each language prints them (rulesets/superhero/en-verbs.zil
  defines HERO-REPORT-CHECK and HERO-SHEET), and no setting is assumed."
<GLOBAL HERO-FIGHTING 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-AGILITY 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-STRENGTH 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-ENDURANCE 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-REASON 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-INTUITION 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-PSYCHE 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-POWER 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-HEALTH 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-MAX-HEALTH 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-KARMA 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-ROLL-VALUE 0>
<GLOBAL HERO-LAST-TIER 0>

<ROUTINE HERO-INIT (F A S E R I P POWER)
 <SETG HERO-FIGHTING .F> <SETG HERO-AGILITY .A>
 <SETG HERO-STRENGTH .S> <SETG HERO-ENDURANCE .E>
 <SETG HERO-REASON .R> <SETG HERO-INTUITION .I>
 <SETG HERO-PSYCHE .P> <SETG HERO-POWER .POWER>
 <SETG HERO-MAX-HEALTH <+ <+ .F .A> <+ .S .E>>>
 <SETG HERO-HEALTH ,HERO-MAX-HEALTH>
 <SETG HERO-KARMA <+ <+ .R .I> .P>>>

;"Percentile cutoffs derived from documented cumulative outcome probabilities
  for the historical standard ranks. No original chart or prose reproduced.
  Nonstandard ranks are rounded down to the nearest supported standard rank."
<ROUTINE HERO-TIER (RANK ROLL "AUX" GREEN YELLOW RED)
 <COND (<NOT <L? .RANK 1000>> <SET GREEN 6> <SET YELLOW 36> <SET RED 76>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 150>> <SET GREEN 11> <SET YELLOW 41> <SET RED 81>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 100>> <SET GREEN 16> <SET YELLOW 46> <SET RED 86>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 75>> <SET GREEN 21> <SET YELLOW 51> <SET RED 86>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 50>> <SET GREEN 26> <SET YELLOW 56> <SET RED 91>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 40>> <SET GREEN 31> <SET YELLOW 61> <SET RED 91>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 30>> <SET GREEN 36> <SET YELLOW 66> <SET RED 95>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 20>> <SET GREEN 41> <SET YELLOW 71> <SET RED 95>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 10>> <SET GREEN 46> <SET YELLOW 76> <SET RED 98>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 6>> <SET GREEN 51> <SET YELLOW 81> <SET RED 98>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 4>> <SET GREEN 56> <SET YELLOW 86> <SET RED 100>)
       (<NOT <L? .RANK 2>> <SET GREEN 61> <SET YELLOW 91> <SET RED 100>)
       (T <SET GREEN 66> <SET YELLOW 96> <SET RED 100>)>
 <COND (<NOT <L? .ROLL .RED>> 3)
       (<NOT <L? .ROLL .YELLOW>> 2)
       (<NOT <L? .ROLL .GREEN>> 1)
       (T 0)>>

<ROUTINE HERO-CHECK (RANK REQUIRED "AUX" TIER)
 <SETG HERO-ROLL-VALUE <RANDOM 100>>
 <SET TIER <HERO-TIER .RANK ,HERO-ROLL-VALUE>>
 <SETG HERO-LAST-TIER .TIER>
 <HERO-REPORT-CHECK .RANK ,HERO-ROLL-VALUE .TIER>
 <COND (<L? .TIER .REQUIRED> <RFALSE>) (T <RTRUE>)>>

<ROUTINE HERO-DAMAGE (AMOUNT ARMOR "AUX" LOSS)
 <SET LOSS <- .AMOUNT .ARMOR>>
 <COND (<L? .LOSS 0> <SET LOSS 0>)>
 <SETG HERO-HEALTH <- ,HERO-HEALTH .LOSS>>
 <COND (<L? ,HERO-HEALTH 0> <SETG HERO-HEALTH 0>)>
 .LOSS>

<ROUTINE HERO-HEAL (AMOUNT "AUX" GAIN)
 <SET GAIN <- ,HERO-MAX-HEALTH ,HERO-HEALTH>>
 <COND (<L? .AMOUNT .GAIN> <SET GAIN .AMOUNT>)>
 <COND (<L? .GAIN 0> <SET GAIN 0>)>
 <SETG HERO-HEALTH <+ ,HERO-HEALTH .GAIN>>
 .GAIN>

<ROUTINE HERO-REWARD (AMOUNT)
 <SETG HERO-KARMA <+ ,HERO-KARMA .AMOUNT>>>

<ROUTINE HERO-SPEND (AMOUNT)
 <COND (<OR <L? .AMOUNT 1> <L? ,HERO-KARMA .AMOUNT>> <RFALSE>)
       (T <SETG HERO-KARMA <- ,HERO-KARMA .AMOUNT>> <RTRUE>)>>

